msgctxt "@action"
msgid "&Pipe to Terminal"
msgstr "&Proslijedi u terminal"

#: kateconsole.cpp:168
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "S&ynchronize Terminal with Current Document"
msgstr "&Sinkroniziraj terminal s trenutačnim dokumentom"

#: kateconsole.cpp:172
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "Run Current Document"
msgstr "Pokreni trenutačni dokument"

#: kateconsole.cpp:177 kateconsole.cpp:580
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "S&how Terminal Panel"
msgstr "Prikaži ploču &terminala"

#: kateconsole.cpp:183
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "&Focus Terminal Panel"
msgstr "&Fokusiraj ploču terminala"

#: kateconsole.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "&Split Terminal Vertically"
msgstr "&Podijeli terminal okomito"

#: kateconsole.cpp:194
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "&Split Terminal Horizontally"
msgstr "&Podijeli terminal vodoravno"

#: kateconsole.cpp:199
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "&New Terminal Tab"
msgstr "&Nova kartica terminala"

#: kateconsole.cpp:363
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Konsole not installed. Please install konsole to be able to use the terminal."
msgstr "Konsole nije instaliran. Instalirajte Konsole da biste mogli koristiti terminal."

#: kateconsole.cpp:439
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Do you really want to pipe the text to the console? This will execute any "
"contained commands with your user rights."
msgstr "Želite li zaista proslijediti tekst u konzolu? Time će se izvršiti sve sadržane naredbe s vašim korisničkim ovlastima."

#: kateconsole.cpp:440
#, kde-format
msgid "Pipe to Terminal?"
msgstr "Proslijediti u terminal?"

#: kateconsole.cpp:441
#, kde-format
msgid "Pipe to Terminal"
msgstr "Proslijedi u terminal"

#: kateconsole.cpp:509
#, kde-format
msgid "Not a local file: '%1'"
msgstr "Nije lokalna datoteka: '%1'"

#: kateconsole.cpp:542
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Do you really want to Run the document ?\n"
"This will execute the following command,\n"
"with your user rights, in the terminal:\n"
"'%1'"
msgstr "Želite li zaista pokrenuti dokument?\nU terminalu će se izvršiti sljedeća naredba\ns vašim korisničkim ovlastima:\n'%1'"

#: kateconsole.cpp:549
#, kde-format
msgid "Run in Terminal?"
msgstr "Pokrenuti u terminalu?"

#: kateconsole.cpp:550
#, kde-format
msgid "Run"
msgstr "Pokreni"

#: kateconsole.cpp:582
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "&Hide Terminal Panel"
msgstr "&Sakrij ploču terminala"

#: kateconsole.cpp:590
#, kde-format
msgid "Defocus Terminal Panel"
msgstr "Ukloni fokus s ploče terminala"

#: kateconsole.cpp:591 kateconsole.cpp:592
#, kde-format
msgid "Focus Terminal Panel"
msgstr "Fokusiraj ploču terminala"

#: kateconsole.cpp:704
#, kde-format
msgid "Terminal Synchronization Mode"
msgstr "Način sinkronizacije terminala"

#: kateconsole.cpp:707
#, kde-format
msgid "&Don't synchronize terminal tab with current document"
msgstr "&Nemoj sinkronizirati karticu terminala s trenutačnim dokumentom"

#: kateconsole.cpp:710
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"&Automatically synchronize the current terminal tab with the current "
"document when possible"
msgstr "&Automatski sinkroniziraj trenutačnu karticu terminala s trenutačnim dokumentom kada je moguće"

#: kateconsole.cpp:713
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"&Automatically create a terminal tab for the directory of the current "
"document and switch to it"
msgstr "&Automatski izradi karticu terminala za direktorij trenutačnog dokumenta i prebaci se na nju"

#: kateconsole.cpp:720 kateconsole.cpp:741
#, kde-format
msgid "Run in terminal"
msgstr "Pokreni u terminalu"

#: kateconsole.cpp:722
#, kde-format
msgid "&Remove extension"
msgstr "&Ukloni nastavak"

#: kateconsole.cpp:727
#, kde-format
msgid "Prefix:"
msgstr "Prefiks:"

#: kateconsole.cpp:735
#, kde-format
msgid "&Show warning next time"
msgstr "&Prikaži upozorenje sljedeći put"

#: kateconsole.cpp:737
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The next time '%1' is executed, make sure a warning window will pop up, "
"displaying the command to be sent to terminal, for review."
msgstr "Pri sljedećem pokretanju '%1' prikazat će se prozor upozorenja s naredbom koju treba poslati terminalu radi pregleda."

#: kateconsole.cpp:748
#, kde-format
msgid "Set &EDITOR environment variable to 'kate -b'"
msgstr "Postavi varijablu okruženja &EDITOR na 'kate -b'"

#: kateconsole.cpp:751
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Important: The document has to be closed to make the console application "
"continue"
msgstr "Važno: dokument mora biti zatvoren kako bi se konzolna aplikacija mogla nastaviti"

#: kateconsole.cpp:754
#, kde-format
msgid "Hide Konsole on pressing 'Esc'"
msgstr "Sakrij Konsole pritiskom na 'Esc'"

#: kateconsole.cpp:757
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This may cause issues with terminal apps that use Esc key, for e.g., vim. "
"Add these apps in the input below (Comma separated list)"
msgstr "To može uzrokovati probleme s terminalskim aplikacijama koje upotrebljavaju tipku Esc, npr. vim. Dodajte takve aplikacije u polje u nastavku (popis odvojen zarezima)"

#: kateconsole.cpp:801
#, kde-format
msgid "Terminal Settings"
msgstr "Postavke terminala"

